    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E21_Person"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property property links an E69 Death event to the E21 Person that died.
A Death event may involve multiple people, for example in the case of a battle or disaster.This is not intended for use with general Natural History material, only people.</rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was death of</rdfs:label>
