    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property links an instance of E69 Death to the instance of E21 Person that died.An instance of E69 Death may involve multiple people, for example in the case of a battle or disaster.This is not intended for use with general natural history material, only people.</rdfs:comment>
