    <rdfs:range rdf:resource="http://www.cidoc-crm.org/cidoc-crm/E92_Spacetime_Volume"/>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">This property associates an instance of E93 Presence with the instance of E92 Spacetime Volume of which it represents a temporal restriction (i.e.: a time-slice). Instantiating this property constitutes a necessary part of the identity of the respective instance of E93 Presence. </rdfs:comment>
    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">was a presence of</rdfs:label>
